# GMS stacks this five times off a 95% chance a hit, which at that rate is a
# character who is simply always at five. The steady state is written flat:
# 40% of damage at the top, in twenty levels rather than GMS's thirty.
#
# The ignored defence beside it pays against a boss and nowhere else -- no map
# mob carries any.
